  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support of Kaleidoscope</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to the Asian-Pacific Resource &amp; Research Centre for Women (ARROW) will support Kaleidoscope, a collective of transnational feminist organizations in the Global South working for health systems change to advance access to safe abortion in Africa and Asia. The collective includes ARROW, the MAMA Network, the Women&#x2019;s Global Network for Reproductive Rights, and the Global Fund for Women. The collective and partners aim to increase access to safe and comprehensive abortion care for adolescent girls and young people and eliminate their experiences of stigma, discrimination, or violence. During the grant period, Kaleidoscope will launch throughout the two regions with priority interventions in Kenya, Benin, India, and Nepal. (Strategy: Global Reproductive Equity)</narrative>
  </description>
